CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ bound from the initializer: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
For a class template specialization the initializer of a static data
member is checked by do_initializer on the value only; the member's array
type of unknown bound was never completed, so sizeof rejected it as
incomplete.
